<title>CANADA: CBRS reaffirms Oshawa Group debentures.</title>
<headline>CBRS reaffirms Oshawa Group debentures.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service said it reaffirmed a rating of A+ on Oshawa Group Ltd's unsecured debentures.</p>
<p>&quot;The company's decision to undertake significantly higher capital expenditures (is) regarded positively by CBRS,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
